//! The `scroll-snap-align` [CSS](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS) property
//! specifies the box's snap position as an alignment of its [snap
//! area](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Glossary/Scroll_snap#snap_area).
//!
//! Initial: none. Inherited: no.
//! Percentages: not accepted.
//!
//! Keyword effects:
//! - center: The center alignment of this box's scroll snap area, within the scroll container's
//! snapport is a snap position in this axis.
//! - end: The end alignment of this box's scroll snap area, within the scroll container's snapport
//! is a snap position in this axis.
//! - none: The box does not define a snap position in that axis.
//! - start: The start alignment of this box's scroll [snap
//! area](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Glossary/Scroll_snap#snap_area), within the scroll
//! container's [snapport](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Glossary/Scroll_snap#snapport) is
//! a snap position in this axis.
//!
//! Grammar: [ none | start | end | center ]{1,2}
//!
//! Specification: https://drafts.csswg.org/css-scroll-snap-1/#propdef-scroll-snap-align
//!
//! Author guide:
//! https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/Reference/Properties/scroll-snap-align
//!
//! Purpose and value descriptions adapted from MDN contributors (CC-BY-SA-2.5).
//!
//! Generated from @webref/css 8.7.8. Do not edit.

